{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Golden Kamuy OVA","Bundled with the 15th volume of the Golden Kamuy manga.\n\n\n\n\"Barato no Yuujinbou\" (The Bodyguard of Barato) depicts the battle in Barato. Hijikata and Nagakura sides with the Hidoro clan and get information about the tattoed convicts in the city. On the other hand, Ogata joins Kusuda Umakichi and threatens the police chief to join his cause."],"ja":["ゴールデンカムイOVA",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-37884","ids":{"shikimori":37884,"mal":37884,"anilist":101830,"kodik":"serial-21928"},"kodikIds":["serial-19729","serial-31118","serial-63792","serial-21928"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-19729":"2021-04-12T20:35:19Z","serial-31118":"2021-01-15T18:51:44Z","serial-63792":"2024-12-13T08:27:58Z","serial-21928":"2021-03-05T19:41:00Z"},"title":"Золотое божество OVA","originalTitle":"Golden Kamuy (2018 OAD)","alt":"ゴールデンカムイ (2018 OAD) Golden Kamuy OVA ゴールデンカムイOVA","description":"Дополнительный эпизод аниме-сериала « Золотое божество », выпущенный в комплекте с пятнадцатым томом оригинальной манги. Сюжет посвящён арке «Барато», которая повествует о конфликте между снайпером Хякуносукэ Огатой и героем эпохи Бакумацу Тосидзо Хидзикатой .","year":2018,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Экшен","Приключения","взрослые персонажи","исторический","военное"],"rating":7.25,"popularity":11624,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/37884/10a2ed87832e8f30bf41adfc8151314a.jpeg","width":420,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101830-Gj0fVRkzG14o.jpg","width":1280,"height":370}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-19